<title>USA: Freight Connection says Vitran ups stake.</title>
<headline>Freight Connection says Vitran ups stake.</headline>
<dateline>TAMPA, Fla. 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Freight Connection Inc said on Tuesday that Vitran Corp Inc had purchased 600,000 shares from a Freight Connection shareholder, bringing its holdings to 79.1 percent of company's outstanding shares.</p>
<p>The intermodal transportation company said the shares were bought for $0.75 each.</p>
